  "description": "Tributary C Force AXS SUS is a carbon ebike that takes every adventure further. Ride in comfort with a carbon fiber frame and our Class 5 VRS™. Ride in confidence with stable geometry, a suspension fork, and 29 x 2.3″ tires. Seek more scenic views and end long days with more energy on Bosch’s Performance Line Speed drive system and 625Wh battery. Load up with rear rack mounts and two bottle mounts (or plenty of frame bag real estate). SRAM’s Force/X0 AXS drivetrain will spoil you with effortlessly smooth shifting and wide gear range. Saddle up with Tributary and see how a carbon ebike can expand what’s possible by bike.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
